  "categorias": "Fiestas|Noticias",
  "post_content": "<p>Alcudia de Veo finaliza este fin de semana sus fiestas patronales, de una manera muy taurina.&nbsp;Este viernes se ha probado y embolado el toro Encartado, n&ordm; 38, guarismo 9, de la ganader&iacute;a Castilblanco, adquirido en la Finca Xicl&agrave;.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/08/IMG_5186.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>El s&aacute;bado es d&iacute;a de capones de la ganader&iacute;a de Miguel Parejo y la embolada de un toro de este mismo&nbsp;hierro por la noche. Para el domingo est&aacute; previsto el parque infantil, campeonato de futbito, misa y procesi&oacute;n, cena popular y entrega de trofeos.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bousdivendresalcudia14/img_5120.jpg\" alt=\"img_5120\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bousdivendresalcudia14/img_5121.jpg\" alt=\"img_5121\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bousdivendresalcudia14/img_5122.jpg\" alt=\"img_5122\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bousdivendresalcudia14/img_5123.jpg\" alt=\"img_5123\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bousdivendresalcudia14/img_5124.jpg\" alt=\"img_5124\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bousdivendresalcudia14/img_5125.jpg\" alt=\"img_5125\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bousdivendresalcudia14/img_5126.jpg\" alt=\"img_5126\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bousdivendresalcudia14/img_5127.jpg\" alt=\"img_5127\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bousdivendresalcudia14/img_5130.jpg\" alt=\"img_5130\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bousdivendresalcudia14/img_5131.jpg\" alt=\"img_5131\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bousdivendresalcudia14/img_5132.jpg\" alt=\"img_5132\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bousdivendresalcudia14/img_5134.jpg\" alt=\"img_5134\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bousdivendresalcudia14/img_5135.jpg\" alt=\"img_5135\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bousdivendresalcudia14/img_5136.jpg\" alt=\"img_5136\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bousdivendresalcudia14/img_5137.jpg\" alt=\"img_5137\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bousdivendresalcudia14/img_5138.jpg\" alt=\"img_5138\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bousdivendresalcudia14/img_5139.jpg\" alt=\"img_5139\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bousdivendresalcudia14/img_5141.jpg\" alt=\"img_5141\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bousdivendresalcudia14/img_5142.jpg\" alt=\"img_5142\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bousdivendresalcudia14/img_5143.jpg\" alt=\"img_5143\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8